= Demand Contested Affairs: Economics and Trade Ministry

Placeholder

- @player_list_10: Implement price controls to control the inflation.
- @player_list_11: Reach out to the global market for debt.
- @player_list_12: Initiate public works programs.
- @player_list_13: Implement restrictions on the import of commercial goods to decrease the flow of foreign currency outwards.
- @player_list_14: Incentivize Turkish companies through subsidies to sell their goods abroad and bring in fresh cash.
- @player_list_15: Reform the inefficient state corporations.
- @player_list_16: Go on a standby with the IMF. Though we absolutely despise getting into dialogue with the international capitalists, the rampant inflation has left us no choice.
- @player_list_17: Devalue the Turkish Lira to finally complete the transformation from an import substitute economy to an export economy. Our base and the unions are firmly against such a course of action.
- @player_list_18: Devalue the Turkish Lira to finally complete the transformation from an import substitute economy to an export economy. Our base and the unions are firmly against such a course of action.
- @claims: Return to ministries.
- @powers: Return to the agreement.

